:: Bailey Bath TF Reaction [widget]
<<widget "baileyBathTF">>
<<if $weekly.baileyTFseen isnot true and random(1,5) is 1>><<set $weekly.baileyTFseen to true>>
	<<endevent>><<npc Bailey>><<person1>>
	/* React to PC's transformation. Checks each TF in order and uses the first visible one. */
	<<if effectiveTransformationLevel("wolf") gte 6>>
		<<if $bailey_dom gte 70>>
			Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<His>> stare lingers on your wolf ears. <<He>> reaches out and tilts your head to the side, examining one. <<He>> lets out an appraising hum before <<he>> lets go and shoulders past you.<<npcincr Bailey lust 1>><<glust "Bailey">>
		<<elseif $bailey_dom lte 30>>
			Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<He>> stares at your wolf ears. <<He>> flicks one with <<his>> finger. "You look like a stray." <<He>> brushes past you.
		<<else>>
			Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<He>> stops to run two fingers along one of your wolf ears. <<He>> lets out an appraising hum before <<he>> lets go, bumping past your shoulder as <<he>> leaves.
		<</if>>
		<br><br>

	<<elseif effectiveTransformationLevel("cat") gte 6>>
		<<if $bailey_dom gte 70>>
			Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<He>> watches your feline tail flick behind you, expression unreadable. "Fitting. You do always land on your feet." <<He>> brushes past you.<<npcincr Bailey lust 1>><<glust "Bailey">>
		<<elseif $bailey_dom lte 30>>
			Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<He>> grabs your feline tail and yanks it full force. <<He>> lets go and shoulders past you, wiping <<his>> hand on <<his>> trousers as <<he>> leaves.<<gpain>><<pain 4>>
		<<else>>
			Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<He>> watches your feline tail flick. "I know someone who would pay good money for a pussycat." <<He>> shoulders past you.
		<</if>>
		<br><br>

	<<elseif effectiveTransformationLevel("cow") gte 6>>
		<<if $bailey_dom gte 70>>
			Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<His>> gaze travels from your cow horns to your cow tail. "Cows are in demand. Lucky you." <<He>> brushes past you.<<npcincr Bailey lust 1>><<glust "Bailey">>
		<<elseif $bailey_dom lte 30>>
			Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<He>> glances at your cow horns and sneers. "Pathetic." <<He>> bumps past you.
		<<else>>
			Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<He>> stares at your cow tail with a sneer. <<He>> bumps your shoulder as <<he>> passes through.
		<</if>>
		<br><br>

	<<elseif effectiveTransformationLevel("waterdragon") gte 7>>
		<<if $bailey_dom gte 70>>
			Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<His>> gaze follows your horns and scales before settling on your tail. <<He>> catches it in one hand, testing its weight. "Expensive-looking." <<He>> lets it go and shoulders past you.<<npcincr Bailey lust 1>><<glust "Bailey">>
		<<elseif $bailey_dom lte 30>>
			Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<His>> eyes narrow at your horns and scaled tail. "Try not to break anything," <<he>> says before shouldering past you.
		<<else>>
			Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<He>> looks over your horns, ears, and scaled tail. "You've changed again." <<He>> brushes past you without another word.
		<</if>>
		<br><br>

	<<elseif effectiveTransformationLevel("bird") gte 6>>
		<<if $bailey_dom gte 70>>
			Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<His>> gaze follows the line of your wings. <<He>> straightens a crooked feather. "Someone's going to try to cage you." <<He>> shoulders past you.<<npcincr Bailey lust 1>><<glust "Bailey">>
		<<elseif $bailey_dom lte 30>>
			Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<He>> plucks a loose feather from your shoulder and inspects it before dropping it on the floor. "Pick that up." <<He>> shoulders past you down the hall.
		<<else>>
			Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<He>> stops to run a finger along a feather. <<His>> expression stays flat. "Careful. Someone might want to clip them." <<He>> bumps your shoulder as <<he>> passes.
		<</if>>
		<br><br>

	<<elseif effectiveTransformationLevel("fox") gte 6>>
		<<if $bailey_dom gte 70>>
			Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<He>> stares at your fox ears, then at you. Something flickers behind <<his>> eyes. "Foxes," <<he>> sneers. "I've had my fill of foxes." <<He>> shoulders past you.<<npcincr Bailey lust 1>><<glust "Bailey">>
		<<elseif $bailey_dom lte 30>>
			Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<His>> lip curls at the sight of your fox ears. "Great. Another one." <<He>> bumps past you.
		<<else>>
			Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<He>> looks at your fox ears and stops mid-stride. <<He>> exhales sharply and keeps walking, bumping past you.
		<</if>>
		<br><br>

	<<elseif effectiveTransformationLevel("bunny") gte 6>>
		<<if $bailey_dom gte 70>>
			Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<He>> catches one of your bunny ears between two fingers and runs <<his>> fingers from root to tip. "Try not to get eaten." <<He>> lets go and shoulders past you.<<npcincr Bailey lust 1>><<glust "Bailey">>
		<<elseif $bailey_dom lte 30>>
			Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<He>> grabs both your bunny ears in one hand and yanks your head back before letting go, sneering. "Only an idiot like you would bounce about announcing yourself as prey." <<He>> bumps past you.
		<<else>>
			Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<His>> gaze drops from your bunny ears to your bunny tail. "Announcing yourself to the wolves, are we?" <<He>> bumps past you.
		<</if>>
		<br><br>

	<<elseif effectiveTransformationLevel("bear") gte 6>>
		<<if $bailey_dom gte 70>>
			Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<He>> tugs one of your bear ears between two fingers, examining it. "You make decent muscle." <<He>> lets go and shoulders past you.<<npcincr Bailey lust 1>><<glust "Bailey">>
		<<elseif $bailey_dom lte 30>>
			Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<He>> gives your bear ears a flat look. "Still just a cub." <<He>> bumps past you.
		<<else>>
			Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<He>> stops. <<His>> eyes move over you — the bulk of your shoulders, the way you fill the corridor. <<He>> holds your stare. "You've been eating well." <<He>> doesn't step aside. Neither do you. <<He>> shoulders past you.
		<</if>>
		<br><br>

	<<elseif effectiveTransformationLevel("fallen") gte 2>>
		<<if $bailey_dom gte 70>>
			Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<His>> gaze traces your darkened wings. <<He>> runs a thumb along one blackened feather, slow and deliberate. "Damaged goods sell at a discount." <<He>> lets the feather go. "Unless you know the right buyer." <<He>> shoulders past you.<<npcincr Bailey lust 1>><<glust "Bailey">>
		<<elseif $bailey_dom lte 30>>
			Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<His>> lip curls at your darkened wings. "You had one thing going for you." <<He>> flicks a blackened feather off your shoulder. "Not anymore." <<He>> shoulders past you.
		<<else>>
			Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<His>> eyes move from your wings to your halo. <<He>> stares at the dim glow for a long moment, <<his>> expression stiff. "Stupid little shit." <<He>> bumps past you.
		<</if>>
		<br><br>

	<<elseif effectiveTransformationLevel("angel") gte 6>>
		<<if $bailey_dom gte 70>>
			Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<He>> regards your halo, then your wings. <<He>> straightens your feathers with two fingers. "You'll draw attention." <<He>> shoulders past.<<npcincr Bailey lust 1>><<glust "Bailey">>
		<<elseif $bailey_dom lte 30>>
			Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<His>> eyes move from your halo to your wings. <<He>> scowls at them before bumping past you down the hallway.
		<<else>>
			Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<He>> shoots a glare at your halo. "Take that off. You look ridiculous." <<He>> bumps past you.
		<</if>>
		<br><br>

	<<elseif effectiveTransformationLevel("demon") gte 6>>
		<<if $bailey_dom gte 70>>
			Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<His>> gaze settles on your horns. <<He>> reaches up and taps one with <<his>> knuckle. "Fitting." <<He>> drops <<his>> hand and shoulders past you.<<npcincr Bailey lust 1>><<glust "Bailey">>
		<<elseif $bailey_dom lte 30>>
			Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<His>> eyes flick to your horns with a sneer. "Seems about right." <<He>> shoulders past you.
		<<else>>
			Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<His>> eyes flick to your horns. <<His>> mouth twitches. "Suits you." <<He>> brushes past you.
		<</if>>
		<br><br>

	<<elseif $worn.neck.name is "Bailey's collar">>
		Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<His>> eyes find your collar. <<He>> wraps <<his>> hand around your neck like a second collar, smiling. "Good. Don't lose it." <<He>> lets you go and bumps past you.
		<br><br>

	<<elseif $worn.neck.collared is 1>>
		<<if $bailey_dom gte 70>>
			Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<His>> eyes find the leash. <<He>> holds your stare for a long moment, expression flat. <<He>> reaches up and runs <<his>> hand along your collar. "Someone thinks they own you." <<He>> bumps past you as <<he>> leaves.
		<<elseif $bailey_dom lte 30>>
			Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<His>> gaze drops to the leash. <<He>> grabs it, winds it once around <<his>> fist, and gives it a sharp tug, causing you to stumble forward. "Someone already broke you in. Good." <<He>> lets go of the leash and bumps past you.<<gpain>><<pain 4>>
		<<else>>
			Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<His>> eyes drop to the leash. <<He>> reaches for it and tugs you towards <<him>>, causing you to stumble. Then, <<he>> lets go and bumps past you.
		<</if>>
		<br><br>

	<<elseif $beauty gte ($beautymax * 0.8)>>
		<<if $bailey_dom gte 70>>
			Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<His>> gaze runs over you, slow and deliberate. "Valuable, aren't you?" <<he>> says, before <<he>> bumps past you.<<npcincr Bailey lust 1>><<glust "Bailey">>
		<<elseif $bailey_dom lte 30>>
			Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<He>> looks you over. "You clean up well. Might get more out of you yet." <<He>> shoulders past you.<<npcincr Bailey lust 1>><<glust "Bailey">>
		<<else>>
			Bailey is walking down the hallway when <<he>> sees you. <<His>> eyes linger on you. <<His>> jaw tightens before <<he>> shoulders past you.<<npcincr Bailey lust 1>><<glust "Bailey">>
		<</if>>
		<br><br>

	<</if>>
<<endevent>><</if>>
<</widget>>
